ried to book them together with book_trip, but the request timed out. When I checked Dana's reservations, the flight had gone through and the hotel hadn't. Retrying book_trip could have booked the flight a second time, so I booked the hotel by itself instead. Afterwards I checked her reservations again: there's exactly one flight and one hotel.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_016itwY9Kg5z6wx7kyQqZWX3", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"origin": "SFO", "destination": "JFK", "date": "2026-11-12"}, "name": "search_flights", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_012eE3RPL5oudVYhRvAnouR3", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"city": "New York", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2}, "name": "search_hotels", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Total: $289 + $378 = $667, under the $1000 threshold.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01XbZLnRN5CMLUpB4CzEzuQb", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"flight_id": "F100", "hotel_id": "H1", "traveler": "Dana Lee", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2, "idempotency_key": "dana-lee-trip-F100-H1-2026-11-12"}, "name": "book_trip", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The booking request timed out, so I'll check whether it went through before trying again.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01JXwnaEWZgZXTASYRTsuUnX", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"traveler": "Dana Lee"}, "name": "list_reservations", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The flight went through but the hotel did not. To avoid booking the flight twice, I'll book only the hotel now.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01U7owJRgWzkcDuiAi7Eb1cs", "c